<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan money, bond markets close for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan money, bond markets close for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's money and bond markets are closed on Friday for the beginning of a three-day public holiday. They will repen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the overnight interbank rate closed at 6.173 percent against Wednesday's 6.346 close, with 30-day commercial paper falling to 6.10-6.15 against 6.30-6.35.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
